# Learn2Trade Frontend Guide

Use this rule as the map of the frontend. Prefer the smallest change that matches existing patterns.

**File placement source of truth:** [`docs/FILE_STRUCTURES.md`](../../docs/FILE_STRUCTURES.md)  
**UI/UX source of truth:** [`docs/STYLING_GUIDELINES.md`](../../docs/STYLING_GUIDELINES.md)

Also follow `angular-guide.mdc`, `material-guide.mdc`, and `agents.md`.

## Architecture (summary)

```text
AppComponent (root outlet + global hosts)
  → RouterOutlet
       → LandingLayout | AuthLayout | BaseLayout (/app) | LectureLayout (/learn)
            → feature RouterOutlet
```

Do not put sidebar/navbar in `AppComponent`. Do not use `*-page` or `app-shell` naming. Details and placement rules: `docs/FILE_STRUCTURES.md`.

## Stack (verify in `package.json`)

- Angular + Material + CDK ^22
- RxJS 7.8, Zone.js present
- Vitest (`ng test`); Playwright e2e
- Charts: `lightweight-charts`; notifications: custom `app-snackbar` stack via `NotificationService`

## Path aliases

| Alias | Maps to |
| --- | --- |
| `@core/*` | `./src/app/core/*` |
| `@shared/*` | `./src/app/shared/*` |
| `@features/*` | `./src/app/features/*` |
| `@styles/*` | `./src/styles/*` |

Same-folder `./` imports may stay relative.

## Where to look

| Area | Path |
| --- | --- |
| App root / routes / config | `src/app/app.*` |
| Shell | `src/app/core/layout/{landing,auth,base,lecture}-layout/`, `sidebar/`, `navbar/` |
| Services / utils / guards / models / env | `src/app/core/{services,utils,guards,models,env,initializers}/` |
| Shared UI | `src/app/shared/components/` |
| Features | `src/app/features/{landing,learn,dashboard,markets,trading,portfolio,auth,system}/` |
| Design tokens / theme | `src/styles/` (`_theme-colors`, `_tokens`, `theme`, `_material-overrides`, `_components`, `_base`, `_fonts`, `tailwind.css`) |

### Feature ↔ URL (prefixed shells; old flat URLs redirect)

| Feature | Routes |
| --- | --- |
| landing | `/` |
| learn | `/learn` |
| dashboard | `/app/dashboard` |
| markets | `/app/markets`, `/app/admin/crypto-currencies/...` |
| trading | `/app/crypto/:id` |
| portfolio | `/app/profile`, `/app/edit-profile` |
| auth | `/auth/login`, `/auth/register`, `/auth/banned` |
| system | `/app/testing-ground`, `/app/**` |

