## Guidelines

1. Read the target feature + one similar feature before editing.
2. Place new files per `FILE_STRUCTURES.md` ownership rules.
3. Component/subsystem-specific interfaces → colocated `*.types.ts` (see `core/search/search.types.ts`); static configs/labels → `*.const.ts`; domain entities → `core/models/`.
4. Preserve auth/guard behavior and route URLs.
5. Reuse `shared/components` and `core/services` before inventing new abstractions.
6. Feature-specific dialogs/components stay under the feature.
7. Page chrome: use `app-page-header` for title + actions on pages that need that chrome; do not reinvent per-feature headers. Dense browse surfaces (e.g. Markets) may omit it when a header would waste vertical space.
8. Styles: tokens + Material overrides globally; layout via flex/grid utilities. `.mat-mdc-*` only as `docs/STYLING_GUIDELINES.md` describes; no `::ng-deep` in component stylesheets.
9. Validate with `npm run build` / `npm run test:unit` when practical.
